WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.548
Today we will select colours intentionally. Our work connects with international

00:00:04.548 --> 00:00:06.920
artists and communities around the world.

00:00:07.783 --> 00:00:10.578
Choose three colours that suit your chosen message.

00:00:11.783 --> 00:00:14.279
Test the colours in small labelled boxes.

00:00:15.783 --> 00:00:21.010
Circle the most readable combination and plan where to use it. Justify a revision

00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:23.250
using evidence from another world tradition.
